              </a>
              <a href="/tacoma-security-trailer" class="block bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Tacoma Security Solutions</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Local deployment with same-day delivery available</p>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <AuthorBio />

    </article>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <CTASection
      title="Upgrade to Forensic-Quality Surveillance"
      description="Pixelated footage won't help when you need evidence. Get S-VIDIA FDC technology deployed at your site."
